    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Instructions</strong><br>Control the blue UFO to switch between two paths (left and right) and avoid the robots on the road. Along the way, you can pick up missiles and destroy robots on the same path as you to earn high scores\u2014if they are on a different path, your attacks will miss. At the end of each game, your highest score and travel distance will be recorded. Challenge the endless runner\u2019s extreme limits!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong><br>Click the left mouse button to switch lanes. Hold and drag forward to fire missiles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The parkour map is randomly generated each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn and play.</p></li></ul>",
